deep-coo-cloud
================

This repository is a distribution bundle of the deep-coo-cloud project.

Third-party components and materials:

1. dsh-coo-pet (upstream desktop pet plugin)
   - Repository: https://github.com/vortioxetine213/dsh-coo-pet
   - License: MIT
   - This repository contains a forked/remixed version of parts of that project
     (the `dsh-coo-pet-remote/` directory), used with attribution.

2. Coopanion / Cortico
   - Repository: https://github.com/Pal-AI-Lab/Coopanion
   - License: AGPL-3.0-or-later (application), with separate terms for some
     bundled art assets.
   - This repository does NOT redistribute Coopanion source code or art assets.
     At runtime the plugin reads page assets and figure packs from the user's
     own installed Coopanion directory (under the user's control), and does not
     bundle them here.

3. DeepSeek Harness (DSH)
   - The plugin framework, client/server APIs, and related packages belong to
     their respective authors.
   - No DSH core source code is bundled in this repository.

The MIT license in LICENSE applies only to code written by the
deep-coo-cloud project. Third-party components remain under their own licenses.
